        defendant: [.direct("Did you sell the pill that killed {V}?", "\"No. I only passed along a friend's number. I did not hand over a pill.\""), .direct("What about the group chat?", "\"I wrote that in the chat. I should not have. I was sending a number, not selling.\""), .direct("Did you take $20?", "\"Yes. A friend gave me $20 for the contact. I did not know what would happen.\""), .direct("What did you do in the chat?", "\"I passed along the number of a friend who sold pills. I did not sell anything myself.\""), .direct("Did you take money?", "\"Twenty dollars, as a thank-you for connecting people. I did not think about what it meant.\""), .direct("What do you say about the pill?", "\"I did not know it had fentanyl. I thought it was an ordinary tablet.\""), .cross("You offered 'blues' for $20 in the chat, didn't you?", "\"I wrote it, yes. I did not have any pills. It was a bad joke.\""), .cross("Texts show you sending a dealer's name. Isn't that connecting a buyer to a seller?", "\"It is. I did not think of it that way. I apologize.\""), .cross("An eighteen-year-old is dead. Do you feel responsible?", "\"Yes. I feel terrible about it. I wish I had never said anything.\""), .cross("You wrote that you had blues for $20, didn't you?", "\"I wrote it as a joke in the chat, but I see how it reads.\""), .cross("You knew {V} took one, didn't you?", "\"I heard afterward. I was devastated.\"")],
